00:29:26.350 --> 00:29:29.020
If it were a student host, we
lose students every two years,

00:29:29.020 --> 00:29:30.580
or every year.

00:29:30.580 --> 00:29:32.790
So there are some fantastic students.

00:29:32.790 --> 00:29:33.753
And in fact,

00:29:34.780 --> 00:29:36.870
I think it goes without saying,
that there's a lot of folks

00:29:36.870 --> 00:29:39.650
