what is your drop-off rate, in terms of

00:31:06.845 --> 00:31:09.450
the actual (mumbles) podcasts themselves?

00:31:09.450 --> 00:31:11.283
- So that's a great question.

00:31:11.283 --> 00:31:14.090
I think we've had about
2000 downloads right now,

00:31:14.090 --> 00:31:17.833
which is not very big,
right, it's not big.

00:31:19.364 --> 00:31:20.960
