wasn't the way to launch.

00:32:29.390 --> 00:32:32.683
But I personally listen to
hour and a half long podcast.

00:32:34.270 --> 00:32:37.270
So it's very, I feel, I'm
hoping that the innovations

00:32:37.270 --> 00:32:40.010
