will include analytics,

00:32:40.010 --> 00:32:43.040
and some of them were, some of the,

00:32:43.040 --> 00:32:44.193
the insights into that.

00:32:46.860 --> 00:32:47.693
Yes?

00:32:47.693 --> 00:32:48.620
- [Female in Audience]
You mentioned thinking

00:32:48.620 --> 00:32:52.170
