most time-consuming for us.

00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:02.060
So after we came up with these themes,

00:35:02.060 --> 00:35:04.277
I reached out to our
alumni office, and I said,

00:35:04.277 --> 00:35:06.627
"Can you give me a list
of alums that you think

00:35:06.627 --> 00:35:09.407
"would be willing to articulate

00:35:09.407 --> 00:35:11.260
"their experiences within this."

